{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b8/bf/88411_crt_gFLWl.jpg?r=1634248513","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b8/bf/88411_crt_gFLWl.jpg?r=1634248513","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b8/bf/88411_crt_gFLWl.jpg?r=1634248513","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b8/bf/88411_crt_gFLWl.jpg?r=1634248513"},"name":"水沢愛佳","summary":"明朗快活で前向きで、良い意味で楽天的な性格。\r\n物事をじっくり考えて行動するというより、直感や思いつきを即、実行するタイプ。 \r\n感動屋で泣き虫。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/14/9d/40394_prsn_qfC4N.jpg?r=1607730873","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/14/9d/40394_prsn_qfC4N.jpg?r=1607730873","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/14/9d/40394_prsn_qfC4N.jpg?r=1607730873","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/14/9d/40394_prsn_qfC4N.jpg?r=1607730873"},"name":"増田里紅","short_summary":"新人声優の増田里紅です。\r\n\r\n趣味:歌う事、入浴\r\n特技:空手「旋風脚」","career":["seiyu"],"id":40394,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":88411},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/86/4d/88412_crt_bPQ51.jpg?r=1634248541","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/86/4d/88412_crt_bPQ51.jpg?r=1634248541","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/86/4d/88412_crt_bPQ51.jpg?r=1634248541","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/86/4d/88412_crt_bPQ51.jpg?r=1634248541"},"name":"清瀬優","summary":"完璧主義者で生真面目だが、実は繊細で、傷つきやすい性格。楽観的な愛佳をあきれつつも、密かに羨ましいと思っている。アイスホッケー以外の事には無頓着で、世間知らず。\r\nここぞというピンチに、神がかったプレイが出来き、チームメイトからは信頼を集めている。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/5f/48/40395_prsn_3E3lE.jpg?r=1607731314","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/5f/48/40395_prsn_3E3lE.jpg?r=1607731314","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5f/48/40395_prsn_3E3lE.jpg?r=1607731314","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/5f/48/40395_prsn_3E3lE.jpg?r=1607731314"},"name":"本郷里実","short_summary":"EARLY WING 新人声優 本郷里実です。\r\n趣味・特技：DIY、散歩、雑貨集め、焼き魚をきれいに食べる、\r\n指がやわらかい。","career":["seiyu"],"id":40395,"type":1,"locked":false}],"typ